<!--
  "xd" in the app's own typeface (DM Sans Bold), taken as outlines from
  data/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/com.restartfu.Xd.svg so the icon never
  depends on that font being installed.

  The path is still in the source 128x128 coordinate space. An adaptive icon
  is 108x108dp, of which a launcher only guarantees a 66dp circle; the rest is
  mask and parallax. The group therefore scales the wordmark to about 52dp
  wide and recentres it on (54,54):

    scale  = 52 / 88 (the glyph's source width) = 0.59
    pivot  = (64,64), the glyph's centre in the source box
    offset = (54 - 64) = -10 on both axes

  52dp inside a 66dp circle keeps the same proportion the desktop icon has,
  where the wordmark spans 88 of its 128 tile.
-->
